// Source: cp/lib/iot/index.cp (Unified Industrial, Automotive, Embedded Firmware, Discovery & L2 Telemetry Barrel)
// Consolidated cap:iot standard library barrel covering CAN/J1939, Modbus, DNP3, Siemens S7, KNX,
// Intel HEX/SREC/UF2 Firmware, Garmin FIT, mDNS/SSDP/LLMNR/LLDP/CDP Discovery, and STP/LACP/BFD/PIM/sFlow/VXLAN.


